{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達歷史上最糟糕的一周雪上加霜。如今，美國政府監管機構正就其賬目問題提出質疑。報道稱美國證券交易委員會（SEC）對英偉達的調查正在審查潛在會計問題影響，英偉達股價周五暴跌近 14%，創下自 2025 年 1 月以來的最差單日表現，並錄得連續第七個交易日下跌。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587384.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:23:53.206998+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:58:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:13.840354+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T10:17:13.840354+00:00","content_hash":"e9ebc75732c1764c12c39983ae50ceeaf3391bcf9b19ba6e8d7c8c6a205251cf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}